  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Financing Technical Support in Sierra Leone Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The FCDO seeks to fund the IRC to provide health specialist support in the Office of the Vice President of Sierra Leone. This is a small funding stream that supports the IRC&apos;s and FCDO&apos;s strategic ambitions to continue the provision of embedded technical assistance within the Government of Sierra Leone on health financing for the country, and will be delivered in coordination with the FCDO&apos;s flagship health Programme, Saving Lives in Sierra Leone Phase 3.</narrative>
  </description>
